{"properties":{"screenName":{"type":"string","default":""},"title":{"type":"string","default":"Item"},"image":{"type":"string","default":""},"selected":{"type":"boolean","default":"false"},"compact":{"type":"boolean","default":"false"},"kind":{"type":"enum","values":["item","group"],"default":"item"},"expanded":{"type":"boolean","default":"false"},"level":{"type":"number","default":0},"tint":{"type":"boolean","default":"true"},"badge":{"type":"string","default":""}},"settings":{"width":"220px","height":"48px"},"html":"<div id=\"mi\" class=\"mi\"><span id=\"miChev\" class=\"mi-chev\">▸</span><span id=\"miIcon\" class=\"mi-icon\">▸</span><span id=\"miMask\" class=\"mi-mask\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img id=\"miImg\" class=\"mi-img\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:none;\"/><span id=\"miLabel\" class=\"mi-label\"></span><span id=\"miBadge\" class=\"mi-badge\" style=\"display:none;\"></span></div>","style":":host{display:block;color:inherit;}\r\n.mi{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;margin:4px 10px;padding:10px 13px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid transparent;background:var(--mi-bg,rgba(255,255,255,.06));color:var(--mi-fg,rgba(255,255,255,.9));transition:background .18s,border-color .18s,transform .12s,box-shadow .18s;box-sizing:border-box;}\r\n.mi:hover{background:var(--mi-hover,rgba(255,255,255,.14));border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.18);transform:translateX(2px);}\r\n.mi.selected{background:var(--mi-active,linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(33,150,243,.38),rgba(33,150,243,.16)));border-color:var(--mi-active-border,rgba(33,150,243,.55));box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(33,150,243,.22);}\r\n.mi.selected .mi-label{color:var(--mi-active-fg,#fff);}\r\n.mi.selected .mi-icon{background:var(--mi-active-fg,rgba(255,255,255,.9));color:var(--mi-active-icon,#1976d2);}\r\n.mi-img{width:24px;height:24px;object-fit:contain;flex-shrink:0;filter:drop-shadow(0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.35));}\r\n.mi-icon{width:26px;height:26px;flex-shrink:0;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.13);font-size:13px;line-height:1;}\r\n.mi-label{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.2px;}\r\n.mi.compact{margin:5px auto;padding:9px 0;justify-content:center;gap:0;width:44px;}\r\n.mi.compact .mi-label{display:none;}.mi{margin-left:calc(10px + var(--mi-level,0) * 14px);}\r\n.mi.compact{margin-left:auto;}\r\n.mi-mask{width:24px;height:24px;flex-shrink:0;background:currentColor;-webkit-mask:var(--mi-mask) center/contain no-repeat;mask:var(--mi-mask) center/contain no-repeat;}\r\n.mi.selected .mi-mask{color:var(--mi-active-fg,#fff);}\r\n.mi-chev{display:none;width:10px;flex-shrink:0;margin-right:-6px;font-size:10px;opacity:.75;transition:transform .2s ease;}\r\n.mi.group .mi-chev{display:inline-block;}\r\n.mi.group.expanded .mi-chev{transform:rotate(90deg);}\r\n.mi.group .mi-label{font-weight:600;}\r\n.mi.compact .mi-chev{display:none;}\r\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.mi,.mi-chev{transition:none;}}\r\n\r\n.mi-badge{margin-left:auto;min-width:18px;height:18px;padding:0 5px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--ui-error,#ff4d6d);color:#fff;font:600 11px/18px sans-serif;text-align:center;flex-shrink:0;box-sizing:border-box;}\r\n.mi-badge.dot{min-width:10px;width:10px;height:10px;padding:0;}\r\n.mi.compact{position:relative;overflow:visible;}\r\n.mi.compact .mi-badge{position:absolute;top:-3px;right:-3px;margin:0;}\r\n:host([data-h]) .mi{margin:4px 3px;padding:8px 12px;position:relative;overflow:visible;}\r\n:host([data-h]) .mi.compact{width:40px;margin:4px 2px;padding:7px 0;}\r\n:host([data-h]) .mi.group .mi-chev{transform:rotate(90deg);}\r\n:host([data-h]) .mi .mi-badge{margin-left:4px;}\r\n:host([data-h]) .mi.compact .mi-badge{position:absolute;top:-3px;right:-3px;margin:0;}\r\n","script":"export function init(instance){\r\n    instance._bindingsRefresh?.();\r\n    const resolveImg = (img) => { if(!img) return ''; if(/^(https?:|data:|blob:|\\/)/.test(img)) return img; try{ return (window.IOB&&window.IOB.imagePrefix?window.IOB.imagePrefix:'')+img; }catch(e){ return img; } };\r\n    // An SVG icon (icons-material-svg, icons-mfd-svg, …) is drawn as a mask in the text colour,\r\n    // so it follows the menu theme; other images keep their own colours.\r\n    const isSvg = (u) => /\\.svg(\\?|#|$)/i.test(u) || /^data:image\\/svg/i.test(u);\r\n    const FOLDER = \"data:image/svg+xml,\" + encodeURIComponent('<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 6.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4.5 5h4.6l2 2.2h8.4A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 21 8.7v9.8a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-15A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 18.5z\"/></svg>');\r\n    const FOLDER_OPEN = \"data:image/svg+xml,\" + encodeURIComponent('<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 6.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4.5 5h4.6l2 2.2h8.4A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 21 8.7V10H7.2a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.4 1L3 18.6z\"/><path d=\"M6.6 11.6a1 1 0 0 1 .95-.7H22a.8.8 0 0 1 .76 1.05l-2.4 7.35a1 1 0 0 1-.95.7H3.6z\"/></svg>');\r\n    const yes = (v) => v === true || v === 'true';\r\n    const upd = () => {\r\n        const badge=instance._getDomElement('miBadge');\r\n        if(badge){\r\n            // a number (99+ above 99), a dot for true, a short text; nothing for 0 / false / empty\r\n            const b=instance.badge; const n=Number(b);\r\n            const dot=(b===true||b==='true'), txt=dot?'':(b===''||b==null||b===false||b==='false'||(!isNaN(n)&&n<=0))?'':(!isNaN(n)?(n>99?'99+':String(n)):String(b));\r\n            badge.textContent=txt; badge.classList.toggle('dot',dot); badge.style.display=(dot||txt)?'':'none';\r\n        }\r\n        const img=instance._getDomElement('miImg'), ic=instance._getDomElement('miIcon'), mask=instance._getDomElement('miMask'), lbl=instance._getDomElement('miLabel'), mi=instance._getDomElement('mi');\r\n        const group = instance.kind === 'group';\r\n        const expanded = yes(instance.expanded);\r\n        let src = resolveImg(instance.image);\r\n        if (!src && group) src = expanded ? FOLDER_OPEN : FOLDER;\r\n        const asMask = !!src && (group && !instance.image || (instance.tint !== false && instance.tint !== 'false' && isSvg(src)));\r\n        if(mask){ if(asMask){ mask.style.setProperty('--mi-mask', 'url(\"' + src.replace(/\"/g, '%22') + '\")'); mask.style.display=''; } else mask.style.display='none'; }\r\n        if(img){ if(src && !asMask){ img.src=src; img.style.display=''; } else img.style.display='none'; }\r\n        if(ic){ ic.style.display = src ? 'none' : ''; ic.textContent = (instance.title||instance.screenName||'?').trim().charAt(0).toUpperCase() || '▸'; }\r\n        if(lbl) lbl.textContent = instance.title || instance.screenName || '';\r\n        if(mi){\r\n            mi.classList.toggle('selected', yes(instance.selected));\r\n            mi.classList.toggle('compact', yes(instance.compact));\r\n            mi.classList.toggle('group', group);\r\n            mi.classList.toggle('expanded', expanded);\r\n            mi.style.setProperty('--mi-level', String(Number(instance.level) || 0));\r\n            mi.title = yes(instance.compact) ? (instance.title || instance.screenName || '') : '';\r\n        }\r\n    };\r\n    instance._assignEvent('title-changed', upd);\r\n    instance._assignEvent('image-changed', upd);\r\n    instance._assignEvent('screen-name-changed', upd);\r\n    instance._assignEvent('selected-changed', upd);\r\n    instance._assignEvent('compact-changed', upd);\r\n    instance._assignEvent('kind-changed', upd);\r\n    instance._assignEvent('expanded-changed', upd);\r\n    instance._assignEvent('level-changed', upd);\r\n    instance._assignEvent('tint-changed', upd);\r\n    instance._assignEvent('badge-changed', upd);\r\n    const mi=instance._getDomElement('mi');\r\n    if(mi) mi.addEventListener('click', () => {\r\n        if (instance.kind === 'group') {\r\n            instance.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('menugroupclick',{bubbles:true,composed:true,detail:{title:instance.title}}));\r\n            return;\r\n        }\r\n        // on its own the item opens its screen; inside the sidebar (data-managed) the sidebar does,\r\n        // it knows whether the entry is a screen or a report\r\n        if(instance.dataset.managed !== '1' && instance.screenName && window.IOB && window.IOB.changeView) window.IOB.changeView.emit(instance.screenName);\r\n        instance.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('menuitemclick',{bubbles:true,composed:true,detail:{screenName:instance.screenName}}));\r\n    });\r\n    upd();\r\n}\r\n"}